The clang builtin __make_integer_seq invoked through libc++'s impl
alias, whose first argument is a TEMPLATE-TEMPLATE parameter (N5008
[intseq.make], [temp.param]/1).  The builtin expansion must resolve
the parameter's binding (a template_parameter_symbol_type) to the
bound sequence template.  Clang-only builtin: g++ rejects this file.
